      "message": "Hey Colin, I was thinking about making this change after b/293349612 so that it\u0027s no longer required to have a separate subdirectory for sandboxed outputs.\n\nWith the requirement that the sbox directory gets cleared before each sbox action, I don\u0027t see a way to avoid having the path for output files change when rules are migrated to be sandboxed. \n\nLMKWYT and happy to discuss other options.",
      "revId": "f1814b556d054195a11863794a49520c66faa966",
